classDiagram
    note for CloudClient "List 返回全部精确 PowerRef；DownloadSkill/DownloadPlugin 写文件型缓存；GetMCP/GetPlugin 返回类型定义"
    class CloudClient {
        <<interface>>
        +List() ([]PowerRef, error)
        +DownloadSkill(PowerRef) error
        +GetMCP(PowerRef) (MCPServer, error)
        +GetPlugin(PowerRef) (PluginDefinition, error)
        +DownloadPlugin(PowerRef) error
    }
    class MCPServer {
        +Transport MCPTransport
        +Command string
        +Args []string
        +URL string
        +Validate() error
    }
    class LocalClient {
        +List() ([]PowerRef, error)
        +DownloadSkill(PowerRef) error
        +GetMCP(PowerRef) (MCPServer, error)
        +GetPlugin(PowerRef) (PluginDefinition, error)
        +DownloadPlugin(PowerRef) error
    }
    LocalClient ..|> CloudClient
    CloudClient --> MCPServer : direct, no cache/staging
    CloudClient --> PluginDefinition : actual name + marketplace source
